# Build context is the REPO ROOT (the image needs backend/ + cobalt/), so
# without this the build would ship ~800MB of local junk to the daemon.
# Measured: frontend/node_modules 498M, backend/.venv 142M,
# cobalt/node_modules 138M. None of it belongs in the image: Python deps come
# from requirements.txt and Cobalt's deps are installed by pnpm inside the
# build.

# Dependency trees (reinstalled in-image)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Frontend is deployed to Vercel, not baked into this image
frontend/

# Build output / caches
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# VCS and local tooling
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets must never enter the image; Render injects env vars at runtime
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Docs and local notes
docs/
*.md
!README.md
